    "body": "This isn't an appropriate algorithm to use, as it takes a request, but there is no request in sight here. I think you need to create some algorithm, either here or in Referrer Policy, named \"origin censored according to a referrer policy\" that takes an origin and a referrer policy. Then pass it _current_'s active document's referrer policy and _current_'s active document's origin.\n\nAlso, what happens if it's completely censored? Does the array get a null in it? If so the IDL needs to change to `FrozenArray<USVString?>` and the prose needs to deal. Or does that entry simply not end up in the array?\n",
